<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Teleport started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Teleport started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said Friday it started coverage of Teleport Communications Group Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-18 month target price at $45 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 39-1/2.</p>
</text>
